{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-02-07 14:15:00', 'title': 'HII COMPLETES INITIAL SEA TRIALS OF VIRGINIA-CLASS SUBMARINE MONTANA (SSN 794)', 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., FEB. 07, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII (NYSE:HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE SUCCESSFUL COMPLETION OF THE INITIAL SEA TRIALS LAST WEEK OF FAST ATTACK SUBMARINE MONTANA\xa0(SSN 794). THE\xa0VIRGINIA-CLASS SUBMARINE, BUILT AT HII'S NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION, SPENT SEVERAL DAYS AT SEA LAST WEEK TO TEST THE SHIP'S SYSTEMS AND COMPONENTS."}